    "content": "<p>These are the patch notes for the build available on<strong> December 8</strong>. Update your game to the latest version and play War Robots: Frontiers today!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Match formation rules have been changed:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>If there are 12 players in the queue, then the match starts immediately</li>\r\n\t<li>If there are 6 or more players in the queue, then the match starts no later than 30 seconds</li>\r\n\t<li>If there are 2 or more players in the queue, then the match starts no later than 60 seconds</li>\r\n\t<li>If there is 1 player in the queue, then the match starts in 90 seconds</li>\r\n</ul>",
